<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an English premier</p>
<p>league soccer match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Manchester United 2 (Cruyff 39th minute, Solskjaer 70th)</p>
<p>Blackburn 2 (Warhurst 34th, Bohinen 51st). Halftime 1-1.</p>
<p>Attendance 54,178.</p>
</text>
